WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:05.853
- [Laita] All right Gloria.

00:00:05.853 --> 00:00:06.740
Gloria, where are you from originally?

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:07.573
Where'd you grow up?

00:00:07.573 --> 00:00:09.943
- I was born in Lancaster.

00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:13.220
At AV Hospital.

00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:14.060
- [Laita] And tell me about your family.

00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:15.873
You had both your parents growing up?

00:00:16.790 --> 00:00:20.770
- My birth mom abandoned me and

00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:22.020
she was on drugs.

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:23.270
And when I was an infant.

00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:25.360
She let anything happen to me like,

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:27.070
they did you know, finger me and all that,

00:00:27.070 --> 00:00:28.780
when I was a baby.

00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:30.240
She was just sitting there to just,

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:31.730
you know watching to get the drugs

00:00:31.730 --> 00:00:34.012
cause she was, you know, desperate for it.

00:00:34.012 --> 00:00:35.190
Or whatever.

00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:38.023
And then I don't know
how long it was going.

00:00:39.310 --> 00:00:43.100
So she you know keep,

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:45.280
you know always doing it to
get the drugs or whatever.

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:46.690
- [Laita] So basically selling you out?

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:49.835
- Yeah basically, you know,
letting things happen to me.

00:00:49.835 --> 00:00:52.290
And I guess Mike found out.

00:00:52.290 --> 00:00:53.570
So they took me from hers.

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:56.563
So I was in a lot of different
foster homes getting beat.

00:00:57.870 --> 00:00:59.688
Shot up with heroin, left for dead.

00:00:59.688 --> 00:01:04.285
And like you know,
traumatized or whatever.

00:01:04.285 --> 00:01:07.350
Then my birth mom found
out that she was pregnant

00:01:07.350 --> 00:01:09.847
with twins, with my sister
and her twin brother.

00:01:09.847 --> 00:01:11.957
And she was still doing drugs.

00:01:11.957 --> 00:01:15.912
And she was in a garage
and she gave birth to them.

00:01:15.912 --> 00:01:18.299
Tried to toss them like they was trash.

00:01:18.299 --> 00:01:21.740
And they, she put them in a trash bag,

00:01:21.740 --> 00:01:24.290
tied them up and tried to you know,

00:01:24.290 --> 00:01:27.150
toss them in the trashcan and stuff.

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:30.120
The neighbors saw, so they called 9-1-1.

00:01:30.120 --> 00:01:32.044
She got arrested, so she's doing life.

00:01:32.044 --> 00:01:36.000
And I don't know her first
name and none of that.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:37.460
I don't know nothing about her,

00:01:37.460 --> 00:01:38.902
I don't know nothing about my father.

00:01:38.902 --> 00:01:42.280
But my baby brother didn't
survive but she did.

00:01:42.280 --> 00:01:44.610
Like she's 14 now, you know,

00:01:44.610 --> 00:01:48.380
she don't know she's, you
know confused and stuff.

00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:50.440
And you know.

00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:53.590
And I didn't even know until
my adoptive mom told me.

00:01:53.590 --> 00:01:55.480
We didn't even know she
was our adoptive mom

00:01:55.480 --> 00:01:57.420
until she told us when I was like,

00:01:57.420 --> 00:01:59.244
probably like seven years old.

00:01:59.244 --> 00:02:02.800
And she was like, you
know, a little younger.

00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:04.501
And we thought she was our birth mom.

00:02:04.501 --> 00:02:07.880
We felt bad, sad, depressed,

00:02:07.880 --> 00:02:10.505
like we was wondering
like, who's our birth mom?

00:02:10.505 --> 00:02:12.750
What's she look like?

00:02:12.750 --> 00:02:13.740
Where we came from?

00:02:13.740 --> 00:02:16.300
She told us and this and that.

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:18.130
She told her that she gave,

00:02:18.130 --> 00:02:20.477
she was born in a garage
and I was born in AV,

00:02:20.477 --> 00:02:22.823
AV Hospital.

00:02:22.823 --> 00:02:23.810
And stuff.

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:26.015
And then we was like, you know, torn,

00:02:26.015 --> 00:02:27.609
but at the same time you know,

00:02:27.609 --> 00:02:30.882
we gotta, you know,
suck it up or whatever.

00:02:30.882 --> 00:02:32.093
And,

00:02:33.280 --> 00:02:35.390
I was 14 whatever.

00:02:35.390 --> 00:02:39.725
My god-dad passed away
before my 15th birthday.

00:02:39.725 --> 00:02:41.140
He was (mumbles) or whatever,

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:42.190
I didn't know what to do.

00:02:42.190 --> 00:02:44.552
I started thinking negative about myself.

00:02:44.552 --> 00:02:48.330
He was the only person I
could open up to or go to,

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:50.240
and trust.

00:02:50.240 --> 00:02:53.910
Him, couple days later I find
out my auntie passed away.

00:02:53.910 --> 00:02:55.720
Couple days later my cousin passed away,

00:02:55.720 --> 00:02:57.316
like three deaths at once.

00:02:57.316 --> 00:03:00.500
In different months and years and stuff.

00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:02.721
And I thought I can't do it no more.

00:03:02.721 --> 00:03:04.790
So I started hanging out
with the wrong crowd.

00:03:04.790 --> 00:03:09.790
Got us to weed, weed and
alcohol, started drinking.

00:03:09.936 --> 00:03:13.637
Thought I was cool, so ran away from home,

00:03:13.637 --> 00:03:14.760
got on the street.

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:16.215
Going back and forth.

00:03:16.215 --> 00:03:20.288
And I'd do whatever to,
you know, to fit in,

00:03:20.288 --> 00:03:21.919
cause I didn't know how to fit in.

00:03:21.919 --> 00:03:25.600
I was looking for love
in the wrong places.

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:28.865
And trusting guys, got set up, got raped.

00:03:28.865 --> 00:03:31.780
Gun pulled to my head twice.

00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:35.129
Forced me to, you know, do
stuff with guys to make money

00:03:35.129 --> 00:03:37.260
or sell drugs.

00:03:37.260 --> 00:03:39.510
If I don't do it, they gonna end my life

00:03:39.510 --> 00:03:41.160
or end my family life.

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:42.750
And I didn't wanted that.

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:44.600
So I started doing whatever I gotta do

00:03:44.600 --> 00:03:47.349
to order to keep my family
alive and keep myself alive.

00:03:47.349 --> 00:03:51.180
And so I started selling drugs.

00:03:51.180 --> 00:03:53.110
Started stealing from the stores,

00:03:53.110 --> 00:03:55.634
selling baby clothes, shoes and all that.

00:03:55.634 --> 00:04:00.090
And then got caught up with my ex

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:02.510
for a burglary that I didn't do,

00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:04.920
so I went up, got locked up at 16.

00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:06.208
Been in there for like a month.

00:04:06.208 --> 00:04:09.510
Got out on, supposed
to be on house arrest,

00:04:09.510 --> 00:04:11.290
but I didn't get out on house arrest.

00:04:11.290 --> 00:04:12.151
I went home.

00:04:12.151 --> 00:04:14.240
Me and my mom get in an argument,

00:04:14.240 --> 00:04:15.960
she was accusing me of
stealing her cigarettes,

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:19.240
accusing me of stealing
her stuff out her room

00:04:19.240 --> 00:04:21.464
or out the cabinet without asking.

00:04:21.464 --> 00:04:23.500
And every time my little sister do stuff,

00:04:23.500 --> 00:04:25.107
she'd blame it on me.

00:04:25.107 --> 00:04:27.075
And I started feeling some type of way.

00:04:27.075 --> 00:04:30.047
Started like, oh nobody care
about me, nobody love me.

00:04:30.047 --> 00:04:33.050
So I started splitting my wrists, started,

00:04:33.050 --> 00:04:34.413
try to overdose three times.

00:04:34.413 --> 00:04:36.077
Didn't work and I was like,

00:04:36.077 --> 00:04:37.116
"Fuck it it's whatever."

00:04:37.116 --> 00:04:40.798
And you know, just you
know, running in the street.

00:04:40.798 --> 00:04:42.671
Fighting left and right.

00:04:42.671 --> 00:04:46.827
And I didn't like that and I regret it.

00:04:46.827 --> 00:04:48.121
And stuff.

00:04:48.121 --> 00:04:50.347
But it's like, it's really hard.

00:04:50.347 --> 00:04:55.014
Now I started writing poetry,
you know, telling my story.

00:04:55.014 --> 00:04:57.170
It's kinda hard to tell my story

00:04:57.170 --> 00:04:58.700
cause sometimes when I talk about it

00:04:58.700 --> 00:05:00.826
I start crying a little bit, kinda hurt.

00:05:00.826 --> 00:05:03.920
But sometimes I gotta
suck it up, you know,

00:05:03.920 --> 00:05:06.429
to let other people know
that they not alone.

00:05:06.429 --> 00:05:09.330
Cause at first I thought I was by myself,

00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:10.580
I thought I was alone.

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:12.999
I didn't know anybody
had anything in common.

00:05:12.999 --> 00:05:15.390
You know, I thought nobody believed me,

00:05:15.390 --> 00:05:17.670
nobody trusted me, nobody
cared, none of that.

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:20.090
But I do have somebody who do care.

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:21.830
It's like I've been pushing everybody

00:05:21.830 --> 00:05:23.670
that care about me and love me,

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:25.215
and brung the negative from around me

00:05:25.215 --> 00:05:27.203
and pushed away the positive.

00:05:27.203 --> 00:05:29.440
And I realized it in

00:05:30.910 --> 00:05:33.503
October 11th, 2018.

00:05:34.756 --> 00:05:36.550
I gotta introduced to crys.

00:05:37.540 --> 00:05:40.460
I was depressed, I was
tryna end my life that day,

00:05:40.460 --> 00:05:41.707
but someone was like,

00:05:41.707 --> 00:05:44.547
"Don't do that, just
smoke this, have fun."

00:05:44.547 --> 00:05:48.490
So he was controlling
me, every time, you now,

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:51.940
he had me smoke it, he
started ripping my clothes up,

00:05:51.940 --> 00:05:56.500
started, you know, doing
stuff that I didn't approve,

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:58.052
he'd get on top of me, do whatever.

00:05:58.052 --> 00:06:00.510
He controlled me, I can't
leave out his sight.

00:06:00.510 --> 00:06:03.473
He'd get mad when I'm
talking to another guy.

00:06:03.473 --> 00:06:05.530
And I told him I'm not his female

00:06:05.530 --> 00:06:06.623
and he's claiming me.

00:06:06.623 --> 00:06:11.623
And I finally tried to
got away October 30th.

00:06:13.034 --> 00:06:16.219
And that day I tried to overdose,

00:06:16.219 --> 00:06:19.490
that day I almost died if I
never got rushed to the hospital

00:06:19.490 --> 00:06:21.490
I coulda died that day.

00:06:21.490 --> 00:06:26.050
And my adoptive mom found
out, she came out here,

00:06:26.050 --> 00:06:28.689
came all the way to
Lancaster from Victorville.

00:06:28.689 --> 00:06:31.697
To get me, talk to me, telling me like,

00:06:31.697 --> 00:06:32.767
"Why you doing these drugs,

00:06:32.767 --> 00:06:35.357
"I don't understand why
you can't talk to me.

00:06:35.357 --> 00:06:37.322
"You could come and tell me anything."

00:06:37.322 --> 00:06:40.800
But that's the thing, I'm
kinda scare to tell her stuff

00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:42.177
cause I know how she gets.

00:06:42.177 --> 00:06:44.621
She reacts over little things.

00:06:44.621 --> 00:06:48.120
She get mad, she cuts me
out, she bring up the past.

00:06:48.120 --> 00:06:48.953
She's always saying,

00:06:48.953 --> 00:06:49.786
"Oh you ain't gonna be shit.

00:06:49.786 --> 00:06:51.827
"You gone be like your birth mom,

00:06:51.827 --> 00:06:54.667
"doin' drugs on these
streets or being in prison.

00:06:54.667 --> 00:06:57.207
"If you keep it up, you need to you know,

00:06:57.207 --> 00:06:59.027
"fix your life around, you have siblings,

00:06:59.027 --> 00:07:01.216
"your sister is looking up to you."

00:07:01.216 --> 00:07:03.514
And then when she said that
I started breaking down,

00:07:03.514 --> 00:07:05.470
like fuck, like I don't want my sister

00:07:05.470 --> 00:07:08.270
go through the things that I been through.

00:07:08.270 --> 00:07:10.150
I don't want no kids go through the things

00:07:10.150 --> 00:07:11.440
that I been through.

00:07:11.440 --> 00:07:12.730
Cause it's not right at all.

00:07:12.730 --> 00:07:15.087
Cause the things that I been
through and she been through,

00:07:15.087 --> 00:07:18.072
it's not our fault, it's our
parents' fault, you know?

00:07:18.072 --> 00:07:21.311
But at the same time it's
like, I forgive them.

00:07:21.311 --> 00:07:25.593
Not for what they did, but to
order to forgive, to move on,

00:07:26.690 --> 00:07:28.902
not try to hold it against them,

00:07:28.902 --> 00:07:33.110
because we don't know
what made them to do that.

00:07:33.110 --> 00:07:34.845
Cause they probably was
going through something

00:07:34.845 --> 00:07:36.298
they didn't know how to cope it.

00:07:36.298 --> 00:07:38.521
The only way they cope it is doing drugs.

00:07:38.521 --> 00:07:42.600
And drugs don't get you nowhere, at all.

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:47.220
So that's how I feel
and hurt and all that.

00:07:47.220 --> 00:07:48.420
- [Laita] So today you're living where?

00:07:48.420 --> 00:07:49.826
- [Gloria] In a tent.

00:07:49.826 --> 00:07:51.640
- [Laita] On Skid Row.

00:07:51.640 --> 00:07:53.350
- [Gloria] In the Skid Row, yeah.

00:07:53.350 --> 00:07:55.030
- [Laita] And, using crystal meth.

00:07:55.030 --> 00:07:56.240
- [Gloria] Doing crystal meth.

00:07:56.240 --> 00:07:57.245
- [Laita] What do you do for money now?

00:07:57.245 --> 00:07:58.948
- [Gloria] I panhandle.

00:07:58.948 --> 00:08:03.948
Or only if I can't do what I need to do.

00:08:05.360 --> 00:08:08.306
I probably sell my body only
like once or twice, that's it.

00:08:08.306 --> 00:08:09.139
- [Laita] Oh.

00:08:09.139 --> 00:08:10.713
- [Gloria] That I, that I know of.

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:13.163
And I'm scared to do that again.

00:08:13.163 --> 00:08:14.246
- [Laita] Yeah you should be.

00:08:14.246 --> 00:08:16.290
- [Gloria] Yeah.

00:08:16.290 --> 00:08:17.950
- [Laita] And do you have any family,

00:08:17.950 --> 00:08:19.730
or friends that you can go to, or?

00:08:19.730 --> 00:08:22.540
- [Gloria] I mean, my family,
they kinda talk to me,

00:08:22.540 --> 00:08:23.890
but they barely talk to me now

00:08:23.890 --> 00:08:27.650
because of my adoptive mom
cause wherever she find out

00:08:27.650 --> 00:08:30.840
what I do and the drugs
that I do, they don't,

00:08:30.840 --> 00:08:32.377
my family don't mess with me cause

00:08:32.377 --> 00:08:33.767
the drugs I'm doing,

00:08:33.767 --> 00:08:36.350
and they want the best for me,

00:08:36.350 --> 00:08:38.176
but they don't want me around them.

00:08:38.176 --> 00:08:41.470
When I'm on drugs or, and stuff.

00:08:41.470 --> 00:08:46.470
They say if I could get myself
clean, get the help I need,

00:08:46.490 --> 00:08:49.036
to order to just come
back around the family.

00:08:49.036 --> 00:08:51.869
(cars driving by)

00:08:52.879 --> 00:08:54.113
- [Laita] What do you think about your,

00:08:54.113 --> 00:08:55.950
what was the biggest
factor in your childhood

00:08:55.950 --> 00:08:58.100
that kinda set you on
this path, you think?

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:00.760
- [Gloria] That made me -

00:09:00.760 --> 00:09:02.248
- [Laita] The molestation, or the -

00:09:02.248 --> 00:09:03.380
- [Gloria] The molestation.

00:09:03.380 --> 00:09:06.090
- [Laita] Or your mom not
being around, or dad, or.

00:09:06.090 --> 00:09:10.066
- The molestation, cause I feel
like a part of me is missing

00:09:10.066 --> 00:09:14.410
but I can't actually know
what about that but myself

00:09:15.370 --> 00:09:17.168
and my birth mom.

00:09:17.168 --> 00:09:21.510
Because ever since that day, what she did

00:09:21.510 --> 00:09:22.978
to me and my siblings.

00:09:22.978 --> 00:09:27.978
I been lost, unsure, don't
know what's going on,

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:31.823
I want answers, but I don't
know how imma get it though.

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:34.100
From her.

00:09:34.100 --> 00:09:35.931
Don't know if she's still alive or not.

00:09:35.931 --> 00:09:38.120
I'm scared to look for her,

00:09:38.120 --> 00:09:41.153
scared to know who she really is.

00:09:42.450 --> 00:09:44.380
And I'm scared to be running up like her.

00:09:44.380 --> 00:09:45.929
I know I can do better.

00:09:45.929 --> 00:09:47.720
And smarter than that.

00:09:47.720 --> 00:09:49.517
And do anything I could put my mind to.

00:09:49.517 --> 00:09:52.000
- [Laita] You're 21?

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:52.833
- I'm only 18.

00:09:52.833 --> 00:09:53.666
- [Laita] Oh you're 18.

00:09:59.428 --> 00:10:00.570
And you have a boyfriend?

00:10:00.570 --> 00:10:01.770
- Yes, I do.

00:10:01.770 --> 00:10:03.290
- [Laita] And he's good to you, or?

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:05.340
How does that relationship?

00:10:05.340 --> 00:10:06.880
- Our relationship is really good.

00:10:06.880 --> 00:10:09.396
We get in an argument here
and there, you know, a little

00:10:09.396 --> 00:10:13.380
ups and downs but you know,
he always treat me right.

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:15.140
He makes sure I'm safe, you know.

00:10:15.140 --> 00:10:17.440
And nothing harm me or none of that.

00:10:17.440 --> 00:10:22.440
He's the only guy that I ever
trust that I could talk to.

00:10:22.532 --> 00:10:24.861
Me and him been best
friends for two years.

00:10:24.861 --> 00:10:28.290
And I don't know where we
finally found out that we had

00:10:28.290 --> 00:10:30.543
liked each other and then we got together.

00:10:34.304 --> 00:10:35.460
- [Laita] Where would you like to be

00:10:35.460 --> 00:10:36.610
in a couple years?

00:10:36.610 --> 00:10:40.470
I mean you got any
plans for doing anything

00:10:42.060 --> 00:10:43.623
to get off the streets?

00:10:44.479 --> 00:10:47.610
- That I haven't think of yet,

00:10:47.610 --> 00:10:52.610
but I was thinking to put my
poetry out there like that.

00:10:52.798 --> 00:10:57.798
Or put it on Facebook, making
something to put it out

00:10:58.537 --> 00:11:01.449
on Facebook to let
everybody see on Facebook.

00:11:01.449 --> 00:11:04.349
And let them know that never give up

00:11:04.349 --> 00:11:08.487
because if you give up,
you don't know if you could

00:11:08.487 --> 00:11:10.419
achieve your goals.

00:11:10.419 --> 00:11:13.260
Cause how you gone achieve your goals

00:11:13.260 --> 00:11:14.920
if you'll give up?

00:11:14.920 --> 00:11:15.913
Keep trying.

00:11:16.810 --> 00:11:18.890
Even though if you fail, get back up.

00:11:18.890 --> 00:11:21.300
And keep going.

00:11:21.300 --> 00:11:23.067
Whatever is in the past,
whatever you been through

00:11:23.067 --> 00:11:25.030
and it's not your fault.

00:11:25.030 --> 00:11:26.440
Just keep going.

00:11:26.440 --> 00:11:27.843
And that's all I gotta say.

00:11:30.463 --> 00:11:31.640
- [Laita] You've been
living on the streets

00:11:31.640 --> 00:11:33.140
for how long now, since you?

00:11:33.140 --> 00:11:33.973
- Since I was 14.

00:11:33.973 --> 00:11:35.063
- [Laita] 14.

00:11:35.063 --> 00:11:37.480
